{title: Rooh}
{artist: Tej Gill}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Kehnda ae dil mera mainu,        Tere [Em] naal mohabbtan paavan
Tera [G] baal bingha na hove,        Teri [Em] aayi traun main mar jaavan
[F] Kehnda ae dil mera mainu..        [Am] Tere bina jeena saza [Em] hogaya ve sanu
[F] Ishq tere da,        [C] Nasha ho gaya ni saanu
[Am] Ishq tere da,        [Em] Nasha ho gaya ni saada
[Am] Tere bina jeena [G] saza ho [Am] gaya,        [Am] Raatan nu neend na aave
[Em] Dil tainu vekhna chaave,        [F] Ruk gaiyan ghadiyan sohniye
[G] Ik pal na [Am] kateya jaave,        [Am] Tere bina jeena...
[Am] Teri main rooh ban jaavan [Em] heeriye,        [F] Teri main rooh ban jaavan [G] sohn [Am] iye
[Am] Zulfan di chaan ban jaavan,        [Em] Bulan te naa ban jaavan
[F] Enha khyalan vich [G] main kho [Am] gaya ni,        [Am] Hun tera deewana jaane
[Em] Tej ho gaya ni,        [F] Hun tera deewana jaane
[G] Tej ho [Am] gaya,        [Am] Tere bina jeena...
